post_install() {
  cat <<EOF
Frigate has been installed under /opt/frigate.

Next steps:
  1. Ensure NVIDIA works in this container: nvidia-smi
  2. Copy the sample config if needed:
       cp /usr/share/frigate/config.yml.example /config/config.yml
  3. Place an ONNX model under /config/model_cache/ and update the path
  4. Enable and start services:
       systemctl enable --now go2rtc-frigate frigate-nginx frigate

Bind-mount /config and /media/frigate from the Proxmox host for persistence.
Size /dev/shm for your camera count (see Frigate shm calculator docs).

AUR dependencies must be installed before this package:
  yay -S go2rtc
Repo ffmpeg is enough for NVIDIA hwaccel (nvidia-utils). Optional AUR builds
like ffmpeg-full only matter if you need extra/nonfree codecs.

See /usr/share/doc/frigate/README.md for Proxmox LXC + NVIDIA setup.
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
